Per MVA, Donald Orlando Lee DOB 2/23/73 resides at 3453 Mayfield Ave Baltimore MD 21213.

CHESSIE history shows: 3/2014 (03n1, AR), 7/2016 (03n2, AR), 10.2017 (03n1, 03n2, 071), 11/2017 (03n2, 071), 5/2018 (03n1, 071), 6/2019 (03n2, 070)---related to similar allegations to this referral. At completion of that investigation, Mother and child relocated to Mississippi to live with Ms. Angeles’ brother. It is not known when she relocated to MD. Family Pres case closed 7/19. All CPS hx centers on concerns of DV and substance abuse impacting the care of Dayquan.

5/19 info to worker related to extensive DV by Mr. Hysiim Jones DOB 12/3/97 who is listed as residing at 1631 Ingleside Ave Apt H Woodlawn MD

